- | CUDA | `psyb0t/talkies:latest-cuda` | `linux/amd64` | all seven ASR + Kokoro-82M + Qwen3-TTS-0.6B | ~11 GB |
- | `executor` | yes | One of `whisper`, `parakeet`, `canary_multitask`, `canary_salm`, `kokoro`, `qwen3_tts`. Other values fail startup. |
